@schoolOrigin = https://localhost:7200
@workloadToken = REPLACE_WITH_VEHICLE_WORKLOAD_TOKEN
@schoolId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@branchId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@actorUserId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

### Read-only school authority; scope school.vehicle-authority.read and client allowlist required
POST {{schoolOrigin}}/internal/v1/vehicle-authority/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}","branchId":"{{branchId}}","actorUserId":"{{actorUserId}}"}

### Actor omitted: workload-only operational school/branch check, not human authorization
POST {{schoolOrigin}}/internal/v1/vehicle-authority/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{workloadToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schoolId":"{{schoolId}}","branchId":"{{branchId}}"}
